{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2022-07-19 15:33:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIRLINES BECOMES FIRST U.S. AIRLINE TO LAUNCH ELECTRONIC BAG TAG PROGRAM', 'text': "SAN JOSE, CALIF. , JULY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALASKA AIRLINES ANNOUNCED ON TUESDAY IT'S POISED TO BECOME THE FIRST U.S. AIRLINE TO LAUNCH AN ELECTRONIC BAG TAG PROGRAM LATER THIS YEAR."}{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2022-07-19 10:43:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIR GROUP ORDERS EIGHT NEW E175 AIRCRAFT FOR OPERATION WITH HORIZON AIR', 'text': 'FARNBOROUGH, ENGLAND\xa0, JULY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALASKA AIR GROUP ANNOUNCED PLANS TO GROW ITS REGIONAL FLEET WITH AN ORDER OF EIGHT NEW ADDITIONAL E175 JETS AND OPTIONS FOR 13 MORE. \xa0THE E175 AIRCRAFT WILL FLY EXCLUSIVELY FOR ALASKA AIRLINES UNDER A CAPACITY PURCHASE AGREEMENT (CPA) WITH HORIZON AIR.'}